response:
The incident involves the delivery of AgentTesla malware using a malicious PowerPoint document (Доповідь_050722_4.ppt) referencing Ukraine's Operational Command "South". When opened, macro code creates and executes LNK and EXE files via rundll32.exe. The initial .NET executable (sgegkseg23mjl.exe), obfuscated with ConfuserEx, downloads an image payload containing encrypted data, extracts and executes MCMDiction.exe, which in turn executes the AgentTesla stealer.

